# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules
#
# Already covered by the libraries' own rules, so not repeated here:
#   kotlinx.serialization: Companion/INSTANCE + serializer() of every @Serializable class
#     (data/remote/dto, navigation Routes), which Retrofit and navigate(route) look up by reflection.
#   Retrofit: StoryApi, its annotations and the generic types of its suspend functions.
#   Hilt: @EntryPoint interfaces (StoryWidget.WidgetEntryPoint).
#   Manifest (generated by AAPT): MainActivity, VegamStoriesApp, StoryWidgetReceiver.
#   AGP defaults: @JavascriptInterface methods (the YouTube player's JS bridge).
# Check with app/build/outputs/mapping/release/mapping.txt after changing these areas.

# Glance saves the widget's class name in its own DataStore and updateAll() finds the widgets
# by that name. R8 renames the class differently from release to release, so keep the name
# (the class is still shrunk and optimized) or, right after an app update, updateAll() can miss
# the widgets until the system next sends StoryWidgetReceiver an update.
-keepnames class * extends androidx.glance.appwidget.GlanceAppWidget
